3. Redistribution: you may redistribute the program only unmodified, free
   of charge and with a link to cami.sk. Modified versions may not be
   published or distributed without the author's written permission.
4. No sale: neither the program nor its code (in whole or in part) may be
   sold, rented or included in a paid product or service without the
   author's written permission.
5. Name and logo: the names “Korgus”, “Korgus Sequencer” and the logo may not be used
   for other programs or to present modified versions as the original.
6. Contributions (pull requests) are welcome; by submitting one you agree
   that the author may use it in the program under these same terms.
7. No warranty: the program is provided “as is”, without warranty of any
   kind. The author is not liable for any damage arising from its use.

